{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16201120","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201120","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1620112001:1":{"text":"你好！请问你最近有没有见过什么奇怪的人？","source_cn":"你好！请问你最近有没有见过什么奇怪的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF41EE795E5CD0977","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620112002:1":{"text":"比如，经常在夜晚闯进来，然后在坟墓上蹦来蹦去之类的。","source_cn":"比如，经常在夜晚闯进来，然后在坟墓上蹦来蹦去之类的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD8086B9C5025DAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620112003:1":{"text":"没有。","source_cn":"没有。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDC5DEFD0EB694FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620112004:1":{"text":"怎么会呢？您再好好回忆一下……大概就是一个月前开始的！","source_cn":"怎么会呢？您再好好回忆一下……大概就是一个月前开始的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEA86BDFA80DB926","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620112005:1":{"text":"我已经在这里呆了大半年了。我很确定，最近没有人在晚上闯进来，更没人做那种缺德的事。","source_cn":"我已经在这里呆了大半年了。我很确定，最近没有人在晚上闯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x398D1C9DA9B46E4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","doc